ssion during acute infection"},{"label":"D","text":"All transmissions routes are equally likely to produce severe disease"},{"label":"E","text":"B and C"}],"priority":2,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Parasitology","displayTopic":"Medical Parasitology","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-39da6edc36ba","stem":"About immunology of toxoplasmosis","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Immunology","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Once infected the patients acquire long life immunity"},{"label":"B","text":"Acute infection are marked with high IgG titer"},{"label":"C","text":"IgM confirms current active infections"},{"label":"D","text":"It is developed I early childhood Page 11 of 13"}],"priority":2,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Immunology","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-a21308b8fbbd","stem":"In general ,during which trimester does congenitally transmitted toxoplasma gondii infection manifest most severe clinical outcomes?","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Parasitology","topic":"Medical Parasitology","topicOriginal":"Medical Parasitology","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"First trimester"},{"label":"B","text":"Second trim5+6ester"},{"label":"C","text":"Third trimester"},{"label":"D","text":"All three a approximately the same"},{"label":"E","text":"None of the above"}],"priority":2,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"nee